        // LegalDocumentsDialog.kt
        "1. Scope & Data Controller (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Ambito e titolare del trattamento (Aggiornato: novembre 2026)",
        "This Privacy Policy explains how Finsay (finsayapp.com, package com.kynigos.oikonomos) collects, uses, processes, stores, and protects your personal and financial tracking data. It is designed to comply with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR 2016/679), Greek Law 4624/2019, the UK GDPR, applicable United States privacy statutes (including the California CCPA/CPRA, Virginia VCDPA, Colorado CPA, Connecticut CTDPA, and Texas TDPSA), and Google Play Developer Program Policies. Data Controller contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "La presente Privacy Policy spiega come Finsay (finsayapp.com, pacchetto com.kynigos.oikonomos) raccoglie, utilizza, archivia e protegge i tuoi dati personali e finanziari in conformità al GDPR UE (2016/679), alla legge greca 4624/2019, al UK GDPR, alle leggi USA applicabili (CCPA/CPRA ecc.) e alle norme di Google Play. Contatto: support@finsayapp.com.",
        "2. Categories of Data Collected & Profile Isolation" to "2. Dati raccolti e isolamento del profilo",
        "• Account & Authentication Data: Name, email address, unique user identifier (UID), and profile photo obtained via Google Sign-In (Android Credential Manager) or Email/Password through Firebase Authentication.\n• Private Profile Details (Strictly Owner-Only): Optional fields such as phone number, date of birth, occupation, and city are isolated in a private sub-document readable and writable exclusively by your authenticated account—never exposed to other users during ledger-sharing lookups.\n• Financial & Budget Records: Amounts, titles/descriptions, categories, dates, payment sources, selected ledger currency, incomes, monthly budgets, recurring bills, savings goals, and member split/settle-up entries voluntarily logged by you.\n• Shared Household Data: Member nicknames, roles (Creator, Editor, Registar), shared ledger links, and an activity log of ledger edits visible to authorized members of that ledger.\n• Preferences & Local Settings: Language (EL/EN), theme mode, reminder schedules, and local merchant-to-category memory." to "• Account e accesso: nome, email, UID e foto tramite Google Sign-In o Email/Password (Firebase Authentication).\n• Profilo privato (solo proprietario): telefono, data di nascita, professione e città sono isolati in un documento privato accessibile solo dal tuo account, mai visibili ad altri.\n• Dati finanziari: importi, descrizioni, categorie, date, valuta, entrate, budget, spese ricorrenti, obiettivi e divisioni inseriti da te.\n• Registri condivisi: nomi membri, ruoli (Creatore, Editor, Addetto), collegamenti e cronologia visibile ai membri autorizzati.\n• Preferenze locali: lingua, tema, orari promemoria e memoria locale esercenti.",
        "3. Bank & Wallet Push Notification Reader (Optional, 100% On-Device)" to "3. Lettore notifiche bancarie (Opzionale, 100% locale)",
        "• Strictly Opt-In: The Bank Notification Auto-Catcher (Android NotificationListenerService) is completely disabled by default. It activates ONLY after you review our in-app Prominent Disclosure and manually grant Notification Access in Android System Settings.\n• Strict Filtering & On-Device Parsing: Finsay filters solely for recognized banking and digital wallet notification packages (ignoring personal messages, chats, emails, and OTP/2FA codes). Merchant name and transaction amount are parsed 100% locally in device memory.\n• Zero Transmission & Explicit Save: Raw notification text is NEVER uploaded to Finsay servers, logged externally, or shared with third parties. Detected alerts create a local draft only; an expense is saved and synced to the cloud ONLY if you actively tap Save/Confirm.\n• No Bank Credentials / No Open Banking: Finsay never collects banking logins, passwords, card numbers, PINs, or PSD2/Open Banking tokens.\n• Revocation: You may disable this feature anytime in App Settings or Android System Settings." to "• Solo su consenso: disattivato per impostazione predefinita; si attiva solo dopo la tua autorizzazione manuale nelle impostazioni Android.\n• Filtro rigoroso e analisi locale: elabora solo notifiche di banche/wallet riconosciuti (ignora messaggi, chat, email e codici OTP) interamente sul dispositivo.\n• Nessun invio: il testo non viene mai caricato o condiviso. Crea solo una bozza locale salvata solo con tua conferma.\n• Nessuna credenziale bancaria: mai raccolte password bancarie, carte, PIN o token PSD2.\n• Revoca: disattivabile in ogni momento.",
        "4. Camera, Receipt OCR, AADE/e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. Fotocamera, OCR scontrini, QR AADE e voce",
        "• Camera & Photo Picker: Camera access (CAMERA) or the zero-permission Android Photo Picker is used solely when you choose to scan a receipt or QR code. OCR text recognition and barcode decoding run locally on-device via Google ML Kit; receipt images are not uploaded to Finsay servers.\n• Greek AADE / e-Invoicing QR Verification: When you scan a Greek tax/e-invoicing QR code, the app may perform a direct, read-only HTTPS lookup strictly to allowlisted official tax/e-invoicing domains (e.g., aade.gr and certified Greek e-invoicing providers) solely to retrieve merchant name, VAT/AFM, date, and total amount.\n• Voice Expense Entry (RECORD_AUDIO): Used only when you press the microphone button. Speech-to-text relies on Android's native SpeechRecognizer service (subject to your device/Google speech service terms), and the resulting text is parsed locally into a draft expense. Finsay does NOT record, save, or upload audio files." to "• Fotocamera e galleria: usate solo quando scansioni uno scontrino o QR. OCR e lettura girano in locale con Google ML Kit; nessuna immagine viene caricata.\n• Verifica QR AADE: per QR fiscali greci, l'app può interrogare in sola lettura domini ufficiali autorizzati (es. aade.gr) per esercente, P.IVA, data e totale.\n• Voce (RECORD_AUDIO): usata solo premendo il microfono via SpeechRecognizer di Android. Nessun file audio viene salvato o caricato.",
        "5. Biometric App Lock, Local Merchant Memory & Device Features" to "5. Blocco biometrico, memoria locale e dispositivo",
        "• Optional Biometric & PIN App Lock: Fingerprint/Face Unlock uses Android BiometricPrompt handled exclusively by your device's secure OS hardware. Finsay NEVER accesses, collects, stores, or transmits biometric identifiers or templates (compliant with GDPR Art. 9 and US state biometric laws such as BIPA/CUBI). Any optional 4-digit PIN is stored strictly on-device as a salted SHA-256 hash.\n• Smart Merchant Category Memory: Category corrections for merchants/VAT IDs are stored locally on-device (SharedPreferences) solely to improve auto-suggestions.\n• Reminders, Widgets, Quick Tile & App Shortcuts: Local notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS, RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED, WAKE_LOCK, VIBRATE) deliver user-configured reminders and bank-draft prompts. Widgets, Quick Settings tiles, and launcher App Shortcuts operate locally." to "• Biometria e PIN: gestiti da Android BiometricPrompt. Finsay non accede né salva dati biometrici. Il PIN opzionale è archiviato solo localmente come hash SHA-256 con salt.\n• Memoria esercenti: le correzioni di categoria restano solo sul dispositivo.\n• Promemoria, widget e scorciatoie: operano interamente in locale.",
        "6. Legal Bases (GDPR / UK GDPR), Zero Ads & No Data Selling" to "6. Basi giuridiche (GDPR), zero pubblicità e nessuna vendita dati",
        "• Performance of Contract (Art. 6(1)(b)): Delivering budgeting, multi-currency tracking, analytics, cloud sync, shared ledgers, and data exports.\n• Consent (Art. 6(1)(a)): Mandatory acceptance of these Terms & Privacy Policy (version and timestamp recorded in your private owner-only profile), plus optional bank notification parsing, camera/OCR, microphone voice input, and reminder notifications (withdrawable anytime).\n• Legitimate Interests (Art. 6(1)(f)): Ensuring security, preventing unauthorized access via Firebase Authentication and Zero-Trust Firestore Security Rules, and maintaining service reliability.\n• Zero Ads, No Data Brokers & No Third-Party AI Uploads: Finsay displays no ads, does NOT sell or rent personal data, does NOT share personal data for cross-context behavioral advertising, and does NOT transmit your financial data to third-party cloud LLM/AI services." to "• Esecuzione contrattuale (Art. 6.1.b): gestione budget, multivaluta, statistiche, sync Cloud, condivisione ed esportazione.\n• Consenso (Art. 6.1.a): accettazione di Termini/Privacy e funzioni opzionali (notifiche banche, OCR, voce, promemoria), revocabile sempre.\n• Legittimo interesse (Art. 6.1.f): sicurezza, regole Zero-Trust Firestore e affidabilità.\n• Zero pubblicità: Finsay non mostra annunci, non vende dati e non li invia a servizi IA esterni.",
        "7. Cloud Infrastructure, Security & International Transfers" to "7. Infrastruttura Cloud, sicurezza e trasferimenti",
        "• Storage & Security: Cloud data is hosted on Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore with TLS encryption in transit, AES encryption at rest, Firebase Authentication, and Zero-Trust Security Rules restricting reads/writes to authorized ledger members.\n• International Data Transfers: Because Google Cloud / Firebase operates global infrastructure (including EU and US servers), any transfers outside the EEA or UK are safeguarded by EU Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs), the UK International Data Transfer Addendum, and Google LLC's certification under the EU-US / UK-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play Services: Finsay Pro purchases are processed exclusively by Google Play Billing (we never see or store payment card details). Native Google Play In-App Updates and In-App Review APIs may run discreetly under Google's Privacy Policy." to "• Sicurezza: dati ospitati su Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore con crittografia TLS in transito, AES a riposo e regole Zero-Trust.\n• Trasferimenti internazionali: tutelati da Clausole Contrattuali Standard UE e EU-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play: gli acquisti Finsay Pro avvengono solo via Google Play Billing; non vediamo mai i dati delle carte.",
        "8. Data Retention, Exports & Permanent Account Deletion" to "8. Conservazione, export ed eliminazione account",
        "• Retention: We retain your account and ledger data only for as long as your account remains active or until you delete specific entries or your entire account.\n• Data Portability: You may export your expenses, incomes, balances, and member settle-up summaries to Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf), or CSV (.csv) locally on-device anytime.\n• Immediate Account Deletion: You may permanently delete your account, private profile, owned ledgers, and cloud/local data directly in the app (Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account) or via https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html. Residual cloud backups are purged within standard infrastructure cycles (up to 30 days)." to "• Conservazione: finché il tuo account è attivo o finché non elimini i dati.\n• Portabilità: esporta in Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf) o CSV (.csv) in qualsiasi momento.\n• Eliminazione immediata: da Menu (☰) > Profilo > Elimina account o su https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html (backup residui eliminati entro 30 giorni).",
        "9. Your Rights (Greece, EU/EEA, UK & United States)" to "9. I tuoi diritti (UE/SEE, Regno Unito e USA)",
        "• Greece, EU/EEA & UK (GDPR / Law 4624/2019 / UK GDPR): You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, data portability, object, withdraw consent at any time, and lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority—including the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (HDPA, www.dpa.gr) or the UK ICO.\n• United States (California CCPA/CPRA & State Privacy Laws — VA, CO, CT, UT, TX, etc.): US residents have the right to know/access personal information collected, request deletion, request correction of inaccurate data, obtain a portable copy, and receive non-discriminatory treatment when exercising privacy rights. Finsay DOES NOT \"sell\" personal information and DOES NOT \"share\" personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising. Sensitive personal information is used strictly as necessary to provide requested app features.\n• Exercising Rights: Use in-app tools or email support@finsayapp.com; we verify and respond within 30 days (or the statutory period under applicable law)." to "• UE/SEE e UK (GDPR): diritto di accesso, rettifica, cancellazione, limitazione, portabilità, opposizione, revoca del consenso e reclamo al Garante o HDPA (www.dpa.gr).\n• USA (CCPA/CPRA e leggi statali): diritti di accesso, cancellazione, rettifica e portabilità senza discriminazioni.\n• Esercizio dei diritti: tramite l'app o scrivendo a support@finsayapp.com (risposta entro 30 giorni).",
        "10. Children's Privacy (COPPA & GDPR Art. 8) & Changes" to "10. Privacy dei minori e modifiche",
        "• Children's Privacy: Finsay is not intended for children under 13 years of age (US COPPA) or under 16 years of age (or the applicable digital consent age in your EU/EEA/UK country under GDPR Art. 8). We do not knowingly collect data from children; contact support@finsayapp.com for immediate deletion if you believe a child provided data.\n• Policy Updates: We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect new features or legal requirements. Material changes will be notified in-app or on finsayapp.com." to "• Minori: Finsay non è destinata a minori di 13 anni (COPPA) o 16 anni in UE/SEE (o l'età digitale applicabile). Scrivi a support@finsayapp.com per rimozione immediata.\n• Aggiornamenti: eventuali modifiche sostanziali saranno comunicate in app o su finsayapp.com.",
        "1. Acceptance of Terms & Eligibility (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Accettazione e requisiti (Aggiornato: novembre 2026)",
        "By downloading, installing, registering for, or using Finsay (finsayapp.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. You must be at least 16 years old in the EU/EEA/UK (or the applicable legal digital consent age in your jurisdiction) and at least 13 years old in the United States (or have verifiable parental consent where required) to use Finsay. If you do not agree, do not use the application." to "Scaricando o usando Finsay (finsayapp.com), accetti questi Termini di servizio e la Privacy Policy. Devi avere almeno 16 anni nell'UE/SEE/UK (o l'età legale prevista) e 13 anni negli USA. In caso contrario non usare l'app.",
        "2. Service Description & Strict Financial / Tax Advice Disclaimer" to "2. Descrizione del servizio ed esclusione di consulenza",
        "Finsay is an informational personal and household expense, income, budget, multi-currency, and split-tracking tool. Finsay DOES NOT provide financial, investment, banking, accounting, legal, or tax advice, nor does it execute payments, currency conversions, or money transfers. Displayed currencies are purely organizational labels; Finsay does not perform regulated foreign-exchange brokerage. You remain solely responsible for verifying all figures, tax obligations, and financial decisions." to "Finsay è uno strumento informativo per spese, entrate, budget e divisioni. Non offre consulenza finanziaria, fiscale o legale e non esegue pagamenti o cambi valuta. Resti responsabile della verifica dei tuoi dati.",
        "3. Bank Notification Reader Disclaimer (No Open Banking / PSD2)" to "3. Esclusione Open Banking / PSD2 per lettore notifiche",
        "• Independent Local Utility: The optional Bank Notification Auto-Catcher reads Android payment notifications solely on-device after your explicit system authorization. Finsay is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any bank, card issuer, or payment institution, and does NOT operate as a PSD2 / Open Banking Account Information Service Provider (AISP) or Payment Initiation Service Provider (PISP).\n• Best-Effort Accuracy: Because banks frequently change notification wording and Android battery/OEM policies may delay or restrict background delivery, Finsay cannot guarantee that every card payment will be detected or parsed with 100% accuracy. You must review and confirm every draft before saving and rely on official bank statements for authoritative records." to "• Utilità locale indipendente: legge le notifiche solo in locale dopo tua autorizzazione. Finsay non è affiliata a banche né opera come servizio PSD2 / Open Banking.\n• Verifica richiesta: controlla sempre ogni bozza e fai riferimento agli estratti conto ufficiali.",
        "4. Receipt OCR, AADE / e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. OCR scontrini, QR AADE e voce",
        "Optical character recognition (OCR), QR receipt lookups (including direct read-only queries to allowlisted Greek tax/e-invoicing portals such as AADE), and voice-to-text parsing are automated convenience features that may occasionally misread text, speech, dates, or totals. Finsay is not affiliated with AADE or any e-invoicing provider. You are solely responsible for checking and correcting auto-filled values against original receipts before saving." to "OCR, letture QR AADE e dettatura vocale sono funzioni automatiche soggette a possibili imprecisioni. Finsay non è affiliata ad AADE. Verifica sempre i dati prima di salvare.",
        "5. Shared Households, Member Roles & Third-Party Consent" to "5. Registri condivisi, ruoli e consenso di terzi",
        "When creating or participating in a shared ledger (Creator, Editor, Registar), you acknowledge that financial entries, split balances, and ledger activity logs are visible to all authorized members of that ledger according to their roles. You represent and warrant that you have obtained appropriate consent before entering another individual's personal information or inviting them to a shared ledger, and you are responsible for managing member access in ledgers you control." to "Partecipando a un registro condiviso (Creatore, Editor, Addetto), accetti che movimenti, saldi e cronologia siano visibili ai membri autorizzati e dichiari di avere il consenso delle persone invitate.",
        "6. Account Security, Optional App Lock & Data Exports" to "6. Sicurezza account, blocco app ed esportazioni",
        "• Credentials & Local App Lock: You are responsible for safeguarding your sign-in credentials and device. Optional Biometric/PIN App Lock is a local convenience safeguard; if you forget your PIN or lose device biometric access, recovery may require re-authentication or reinstalling the app.\n• Exported Files: When you export reports (Excel, PDF, CSV) and share them via third-party apps (email, messaging, cloud drives), those exported copies leave Finsay's control and their confidentiality becomes your sole responsibility." to "• Credenziali e blocco: custodisci credenziali e dispositivo. Se dimentichi il PIN locale potrebbe servire un nuovo accesso o reinstallazione.\n• File esportati: la riservatezza dei report (Excel, PDF, CSV) condivisi tramite app terze è sotto la tua responsabilità.",
        "7. Finsay Pro Subscriptions, Renewals & Refunds (Google Play)" to "7. Abbonamenti Finsay Pro, rinnovi e rimborsi",
        "• Billing & Auto-Renewal: Certain advanced features (such as Bank Notification Auto-Catcher, multiple ledgers, and unlimited members) require a Finsay Pro subscription or lifetime purchase processed exclusively via Google Play Billing. Recurring subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled in Google Play settings before the end of the current billing period.\n• Refunds & Consumer Rights: Pricing, cancellations, and refund requests are governed by Google Play's billing policies and applicable mandatory consumer laws in your jurisdiction (including statutory EU/UK withdrawal rights where applicable and US consumer statutes)." to "• Fatturazione: le funzioni avanzate richiedono Finsay Pro via Google Play Billing. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente salvo disdetta su Google Play.\n• Rimborsi: regolati da Google Play e dalle norme inderogabili a tutela dei consumatori.",
        "8. Acceptable Use & Intellectual Property" to "8. Uso consentito e proprietà intellettuale",
        "You agree not to misuse Finsay, bypass authentication or security rules, attempt unauthorized access to other users' data, reverse-engineer or copy proprietary components except as permitted by mandatory law, or use the app for fraudulent or unlawful purposes. All Finsay trademarks, branding, design, and software remain the intellectual property of Finsay and its creators." to "Accetti di non abusare di Finsay, aggirare la sicurezza, accedere senza autorizzazione a dati altrui o copiare il software. Marchi, design e codice appartengono a Finsay.",
        "9. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability" to "9. Esclusione di garanzie e limitazione di responsabilità",
        "To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finsay is provided \"AS IS\" and \"AS AVAILABLE\" without warranties of uninterrupted operation or error-free parsing. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Finsay and its developers shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, punitive, or consequential damages, missed bill reminders, unparsed notifications, or loss of profits/data; aggregate liability shall not exceed the total amount paid by you for Finsay Pro during the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.\n• Statutory Carve-Out (EU/UK/US): Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded under mandatory law (including gross negligence, willful misconduct, fraud, or mandatory statutory consumer rights in the EU/EEA, UK, or US states)." to "Nei limiti di legge, Finsay è fornita \"COSÌ COM'È\" senza garanzie di operatività ininterrotta. La responsabilità complessiva non supera quanto pagato per Finsay Pro negli ultimi 12 mesi, fatti salvi i diritti inderogabili dei consumatori (UE/SEE, UK, USA).",
        "10. Termination, Changes, Governing Law & International Consumer Rights" to "10. Risoluzione, modifiche e legge applicabile",
        "• Termination: You may terminate your account anytime via Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account. We may suspend accounts that materially violate these Terms or threaten platform security.\n• Governing Law & Consumer Carve-Out: These Terms are governed by the laws of the Hellenic Republic (Greece) and applicable European Union law, with disputes submitted to the courts of Athens, Greece. However, if you are a consumer residing in the EU/EEA, the UK, or the United States, nothing in these Terms deprives you of the mandatory consumer protection laws or statutory forum rights of your country or state of residence.\n• Contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "• Risoluzione: puoi chiudere il tuo account da Menu (☰) > Profilo > Elimina account.\n• Legge applicabile: legge greca ed europea (foro di Atene), fatti salvi i diritti inderogabili di tutela dei consumatori del tuo Paese di residenza.\n• Contatto: support@finsayapp.com."
    )
}
